{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>9to5Mac 由 MacPaw 旗下嘅 CleanMyMac 呈獻。隨住 macOS 27 金門橋（Golden Gate）推出，用 CleanMyMac 先騰出空間、優化系統，確保你部新 Mac 喺第一日就能以 100% 效能運行。了解更多。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 金門橋相比 macOS 26 Tahoe 係一次重大升級，而且唔單止係設計決策更加明智。正如 iPhone 嘅 iOS 27 咁，Mac 今次都加入咗 Liquid Glass 外觀滑桿。用戶可以透過佢大幅改變整個系統嘅 Mac 介面外觀。</p>\n<h2>滑桿</h2>\n<p>Liquid Glass 係 Apple 嘅設計語言，最初由 iOS 26 同 macOS 26 Tahoe 開始採用。Liquid Glass 一開始得單一種外觀，Apple 之後加入咗一個設定選項，令 Liquid Glass 冇咁通透。</p>\n<p>由 iOS 27 同 macOS 27 金門橋開始，Liquid Glass 再唔係只有兩種風格。Apple 引入咗一個外觀滑桿，可以令 Liquid Glass 比以前更加清透。同時亦可以將佢變成更不透明，但仍然保持現代感嘅外觀。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 金門橋預設採用中等設定。系統亦會喺初始設定過程中邀請你調整滑桿。你之後亦可以喺「系統設定 &gt; 外觀」入面再調整滑桿。</p>\n<p>Liquid Glass 滑桿提供每個設定嘅實時預覽。三個刻度分別代表最通透、中等同最不透明。當然，你亦可以將滑桿設定喺任何刻度之間嘅位置。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Ultraclear.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Default.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Fully-Tinted.webp?w=800\"/>\n<h2>Dock 底座</h2>\n<p>Dock 係隨 Liquid Glass 滑桿設定而改變外觀嘅最明顯元件。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<p>佢嘅範圍可以由清晰展示你嘅桌面壁紙，到變成一種更不透明、更實在嘅材質。</p>\n<p>以下係近距離睇嘅效果：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<h2>Widgets 工具</h2>\n<p>macOS 桌面工具可以用全彩、暗淡，或者自動調整。Liquid Glass 滑桿亦會改變暗淡工具嘅外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<h2>Apple Music 同 Podcasts</h2>\n<p>Apple Music 同 Podcast 等有系統「播放中」控制欄嘅應用程式，會根據 Liquid Glass 滑桿嘅位置而呈現截然不同嘅外觀。</p>\n<p>以下係 Podcast 嘅「播放中」控制欄為例：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>而 Music 嘅效果如下：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<h2>更多</h2>\n<p>滑桿亦會套用喺側邊欄、工具欄同工具欄按鈕上。Photos、Safari 同其他有視窗介面元素嘅應用程式外觀都會因而改變。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>macOS 27 金門橋 嘅 Liquid Glass 滑桿有一點要注意：單一滑桿控制成個系統嘅所有 Liquid Glass 外觀。即係話 Dock、工具同視窗介面元素都會統一同一種風格。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-03.webp\"/>\n<p>你鍾意邊種？更通透、更不透明，定係中間？我個人就好鍾意更不透明嗰個選項喺我部 Mac 上呈現嘅成熟美觀感覺。當然，試吓更通透嘅效果都好有趣，我好高興 macOS 27 金門橋畀大家自主揀嘅權利。</p>\n<p>喺留言區分享你嘅想法啦！</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/CMM-Body-Image-1.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T01:31:39.086643+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1201,"images":25,"source":"9to5Mac","fallback":"none"}}